{{Quote|Grants explosive movement abilities, allowing quick travel and attacks.|Shop}}
'''Rocket''' is a {{Common}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|5,000}} or {{Robux|50}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Rocket allows the user to shoot out explosive projectiles from their body, dealing significant damage. The user can also fly using their rocket abilities.

__TOC__{{Clr}}

