==Overview==
<tabber> 
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Very easy to obtain as it is always in [[Blox Fruits "Stock"|Stock]].
* Very low mastery requirements.
* Fast cooldowns.
* Great mobility for a {{Common}} fruit.
* All moves have no/low end-lag.
* Good grinding for new players in [[First Sea]].
* All attack moves break [[Instinct]].
* Decent combo potential.
|'''[Z] Missile Fist'''
* Quick start.
* Decent [[AoE]] if the missile hits the ground.
* Decent range.
* Has slight aim-assist.

|'''[X] Air Strike'''
* Decent [[AoE]].
* Decent range.

|'''[C] Rocket Crash'''
* Good [[Area of Effect|AoE]] and range.
* Good for travelling due to the high distance it can travel if the cursor is a great distance from the user.
* Good for dodging and countering an attack.
* Quick start-up.

|'''[F] Blast Off'''
* Good vertical mobility.
* Good for evading chip-damage attacks like [[Dough]] [C] and [[Ice]] [V].
* Good for getting into position for air combos.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Relatively low damage output.
* Weak in aerial combat, as [X] and [C] move only targets the ground. 
* Not recommended to use at high levels, as there are better options.

|'''[Z] Missile Fist'''
* Small hitbox.
* The missile travels slowly.

|'''[X] Air Strike'''
* Easy to avoid.
* Cannot be used under a low roof.
* A bit slow.
* Narrow range.

|'''[C] Rocket Crash'''
* Start-up has a slight delay.

|'''[F] Blast Off'''
* Fairly slow.
}}
</tabber>

