==Trivia==
* A physical Rocket fruit can be purchased from [[Dog House (Wenlock)|Wenlock]] for {{Robux|97}}, despite its permanent version from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]] costing just {{Robux|50}}.
** This makes Rocket the only fruit that can be purchased as a physical fruit for {{Robux}}.
* Rocket, along with [[Spin]], is the only [[Blox Fruits|fruit]] to always be in [[Stock]].
* Rocket is used by the [[Cyborg]] boss, who uses the [X] skill.
* Although Rocket is cheaper than [[Spin]], Spin is considered worse than Rocket.
* Rocket is the first fruit, both in stocks and [[Common]] rarity fruits.

